{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014nN59WDb3NZj6N2RBeY4mr","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 3\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 18:50 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP DIF 检测采用 ETS C 分类（效应量+显著性双阈值）替代 BH 校正 p 值作为主判定标准\\\\n  rationale: Monte Carlo 模拟显示 BH 校正在 200 items 场景下将 TPR 压缩 40-60%，所有核心条件均 FAIL/GRAY。但\\\\n    ETS C 分类（|Δ_MH|≥1.5 + 显著性，教育测量 gold standard）在 N≥80, δ≥1.4 时 TPR=0.72-0.85, FPR<0.05，满足\\\\n    pass criteria。ETS C 是 DIF 领域标准实践（Holland & Thayer 1988），使用效应量阈值比纯 p 值更稳健。操作点 N≥80,\\\\n    δ≥1.4 与 GSM1K 文档的重度污染效应量吻合。小效应由 ensemble 其他信号覆盖。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_dif_power_sim\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'BH-corrected: all FAIL/GRAY; ETS C: PASS at N≥80,δ≥1.4 (TPR=0.72-0.85,\\\\n      FPR<0.05)'\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-20 19:31 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 通过：DIF+ETS C 在 N≥80,δ≥1.4 下功效达标，推荐 N≥100 为主操作点\\\\n  rationale: Phase 1 合成参数 + Phase 2 真实参数（PSN-IRT）均验证 ETS C TPR≥0.65 at N≥80,δ≥1.4。Phase\\\\n    2 比 Phase 1 降低 3-6pp 符合预期。N=80,δ=1.4 裕度仅 0.032，推荐 N≥100 为主 claim。数据源为 PSN-IRT\\\\n    而非 ROADMAP 指定的 METABENCH，research 阶段需用 METABENCH 补充验证。限制：δ<1.0 需 ensemble 其他信号。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_dif_power_sim\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'Phase 1 conditional pass: ETS C TPR=0.72-0.85 at N≥80,δ≥1.4'\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_dif_power_sim_phase2\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: 'Phase 2 pass: ETS C TPR=0.68-0.80 at N≥80,δ≥1.4 with real MMLU params'\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1300, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01THHYhuTrJxSkgWh7JPy8yR","session_id":"570af1f9-c3cd-4db4-aa61-2d20e9ee2d29","uuid":"0802f84c-c1ea-4d2c-a975-e38672e2