{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017dbaXE6BGBG3gddRTFU3nn","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520_2/projects/irt_equated_bench_regen/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# irt_equated_bench_regen — Research Dashboard\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-20 19:43 UTC | 更新原因: BE 重启恢复：更新 Dream ID + plan_003 拆分为 003a/003b/003c + METABENCH 下载状态\\\\n\\\\n## 核心方向\\\\n用 DIF 跨模型发布批次检测 benchmark 污染（RL-robust），结合多信号 ensemble 和 bifactor IRT equating 实现 benchmark 自愈。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: Research（MVP 已通过 D002，2026-05-20）\\\\n- **Framing**: 3 条 Core Claims（Detection / Ensemble / Regeneration）\\\\n- **Plan**: 11 个实验（P0×5 / P1×3 / P2×3），总 GPU 预估 600h\\\\n- **Dream**: dream_20260520T194223 pending（full review，原 dream 因 BE 重启崩溃后自动重跑）\\\\n- **服务器/GPU**: 未配置（等 Dream 通过后配置）\\\\n- **文献图谱**: 10 篇，待蒸馏\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims (from paper_framing.md)\\\\n1. **Detection**: DIF + ETS C 在 N≥80, δ≥1.4 时 TPR=0.72-0.85, FPR<0.05，RL-robust\\\\n2. **Ensemble**: DIF + ConStat + DVD 多信号覆盖全效应量谱\\\\n3. **Regeneration**: Bifactor IRT equating 实现心理测量等价的 item 替换\\\\n\\\\n## Experiment Plan Summary (from experiment_plan.yaml)\\\\n| ID | Name | Claim | Priority | GPU(h) | Deps |\\\\n|----|------|-------|----------|--------|------|\\\\n| plan_001 | real_data_dif_mmlu | 1 | P0 | 0 | - |\\\\n| plan_002 | rl_robustness_validation | 1 | P0 | 100 | 001 |\\\\n| plan_003a | constat_perturbation_eval | 2 | P0 | 80 | 001 |\\\\n| plan_003b | dvd_generation_variance_eval | 2 | P0 | 70 | 001 |\\\\n| plan_003c | ensemble_fusion | 2 | P0 | 0 | 001,003a,003b |\\\\n| plan_004 | cross_benchmark_gsm8k | 1 | P1 | 100 | 001 |\\\\n| plan_005 | bifactor_irt_equating_pilot | 3 | P1 | 50 | 001 |\\\\n| plan_006 | item_generation_calibration | 3 | P1 | 200 | 005 |\\\\n| plan_007 | cumulative_bayesian_dif | 1 | P2 | 0 | 001 |\\\\n| plan_008 | graceful_degradation | 3 | P2 | 0 | 005,006 |\\\\n| plan_009 | item_focused_trees | 1 | P2 | 0 | 001 |\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n- [ ] 等 Dream 回调（dream_20260520T194223），审查模拟审稿\\\\n- [ ] METABENCH 数据下载（首次 Worker 失败，Agent 处理中）\\\\n- [ ] Dream 通过后：配置服务器/GPU，批准 P0 实验\\\\n- [ ] 用户触发文献蒸馏\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\nP0: 250h | P1: 350h | P2: 0h | 总计 600h（项目预算 900-1200h，留余量）\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿目标\\\\nICLR 2027（~2026年10月 DDL，主目标）| AAAI 2027（2026.07.28）| EACL 2027 ARR August（2026.08.03）\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D002 | 2026-05-20 | MVP 通过：DIF+ETS C 在 N≥80,δ≥1.4 下功效达标，推荐 N≥100 为主操作点 | mvp_dif_power_sim, mvp_dif_power_sim_phase2 |\\\\n| D001 | 2026-05-20 | MVP DIF 检测采用 ETS C 分类（效应量+显著性双阈值）替代 BH 校正 p 值作为主判定 | mvp_dif_power_sim |\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2226, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Qu656LLVhAap9jr8QreYqU","session_id":"570af1f9-c3cd-4db4-aa61-2d20e9ee2d29","uuid":"5577b398-863c-4549-b596-3f38df73a823","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:29:18.733Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01PcV2kdK2SPuUjRxSmX8KtP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BQBBKoi6bR9NoZyK5Y3G3r","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"R2 reads R1, updates assessment","prompt":"You are Reviewer R2 (novelty + related work focus). You previously gave this paper a score of 3 (Reject) with high confidence. Now read Reviewer R1's review below and update your assessment.\n\n## Your Original Review Summary\n- Score: 3 (Reject), Confidence: High\n- Key concerns: (1) central negative result is foreseeable, (2) related work is inadequate, (3) negative-result framing overreaches — contributions individually modest, (4) paper doesn't attempt the obvious fix (stratified IRT)\n- Key strengths: thoroughness, correct root cause identification, practical replacement bounds, scale\n\n## R1's Review (Methods + Experiments)\n\n**Score: 3 (Weak Reject), Confidence: Medium**\n\n**Strengths from R1:**\n- Thorough falsification across multiple axes\n- Correct IRT fit diagnostics against standard thresholds\n- Ecologically valid setup (5,055 real models)\n- Honest RL-robustness evaluation\n- Appropriate ETS C classification choice\n- GSM8K cross-validation with independent ground truth\n\n**Key Weaknesses from R1:**\n1. (Major) 12-model RL cohort too small — bootstrap CIs on AUROC would be ~±0.15, the DIF-vs-ConStat gap of 0.07 is within noise. Claims directional conclusions data can't support.\n2. (Major) Starting with unidimensional 2PL was predictable failure — the more informative experiment would start with MIRT. Bifactor rho=0.85 is the actual empirical contribution.\n3. (Major) Architecture-contamination confounding not controlled — no architecture-stratified DIF. Most important missing experiment.\n4. (Moderate) GSM8K N=48 without power analysis — can't detect rho<0.40 reliably\n5. (Moderate) Ground truth quality (MMLU-CF, GSM1K) insufficiently interrogated — low phi could be noisy ground truth not broken detector\n6. (Moderate) Ensemble \"failure\" could reflect ground truth limitations not signal redundancy\n7. (Moderate) Graceful degradation uses circular reasoning — depends on worst-tier calibration quality\n8. (Minor) Power retention ratio definition ambiguous\n9. (Minor) Cumulative Bayesian DIF lacks specification\n10. (Minor) IFT computation cost seems high\n\n**R1's Missing Experiments:**\n1. Architecture-stratified DIF (most important)\n2. Semi-synthetic validation with known contamination injection\n3. Statistical comparison of AUROC differences (DeLong test)\n4. IRT fit for architecture-homogeneous subgroups\n5. Sensitivity of degradation to calibration quality\n6. Contamination prevalence estimation\n\n**R1's Questions:**\n1. DIF within architecture-homogeneous subpopulations?\n2. Bootstrap CIs on AUROC (Table 3)?\n3. MMLU-CF ground truth reliability?\n4. Heywood cases vs slow convergence in bifactor?\n5. RL models showing different discrimination parameters?\n6. Cumulative Bayesian within homogeneous cohorts?\n7. Replacement threshold at best-tier calibration?\n\n## Your Task\n\n1. State which of R1's points you **agree** with, **disagree** with, or find **partially valid**\n2. Identify any **new concerns** raised by R1 that you missed\n3. Identify any points where your review and R1's **reinforce** each other\n4. State whether R1's review changes your score, and if so, in which direction\n5. Provide your **updated score** (1-6) and **updated confidence** (low/medium/high)\n\nBe concise. Focus on where you and R1 converge or diverge on substance.\n","model":"opus"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2784,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6734,"cache_read_input_tokens":58097,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6734},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_